      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agreed that this should be an option somewhere, even as a launch option. As a temporary workaround, you can use the video stream directly through SteamVR. In SteamVR's collapsible menu, enable 'Display VR View', then undock it from the main SteamVR window. A new window should appear named 'VR View', and a new Menu should be displayed in the top-left corner. You can switch the displayed eye there from Left Eye to Right Eye, or even display both eyes with one eye being dominant.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
