  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-10-02T17:41:15.478Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "**Problem:**\nRight now, the left eye is chosen by default on Unity as the desktop view passthrough, this means that gameplay will be shown on the desktop through the left eye's perspective.\nHowever, the majority of the population is right-eye dominant. This means that if they aim down sights they will use their right eye, as such, recordings will look wrong.\n**Request:**\nUsers should be able to change the eye that the desktop passthrough chooses. While making the right one the default one.\nIdeally, this would be an option in the new main menu, however, because of its niche use case (primarily for recording videos without affecting performance), it could be just a launch option.",
